# Local Spark / MLflow scratch. A host-side SparkSession writes derby.log and
# metastore_db/ beside the working directory, and a file-store MLflow client
# writes mlflow.db; inside a worktree they are untracked and `git add -A` takes
# them.
derby.log
metastore_db/
mlflow.db
